-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
REPLACE_THIS_WITH_YOUR_ACTUAL_RSA_PUBLIC_KEY_IN_PEM_FORMAT

This file is only needed when app.dev_mode=false.
In development, set app.dev_mode=true in conf/app.properties
and this file is not read.

To generate a test RS256 key pair:

  # Generate private key
  openssl genrsa -out jwt_private_key.pem 2048

  # Extract public key
  openssl rsa -in jwt_private_key.pem -pubout -out conf/jwt_public_key.pem

-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
